  (text "ISNS_X = VREF_1V25 + 1.0 V/A x I_coil (0.1 ohm x 10); linear range +/-1.2 A; trip window +/-0.8 A (VTH_HI 2.05 V, VTH_LO 0.45 V)."
    (exclude_from_sim no)
    (at 20 251.00 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.6 1.6))
      (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "74647894-3427-5211-872a-a28a3434c727"))
  (text "IN/IN drive (DRV8212P truth table, VERIFY): slow decay = one input held high, the other driven with the inverted duty, i.e. drive (1,0) / brake (1,1). PWM on one input with the other low is drive/coast (fast decay). nSLEEP low = sleep, outputs Hi-Z. Centre-aligned PWM, current sampled at period centre."
    (exclude_from_sim no)
    (at 20 255.00 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.6 1.6))
      (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "3c9c24a0-9051-58b7-9ce6-9db4ec4bb527")))
